{
  "slug": "software-framework",
  "name": "Software Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Software engineering meta-router — 12 frameworks (Scientific Debugging, Bisection, Observability/USE-RED, Hexagonal Architecture, Domain-Driven Design, Event Sourcing/CQRS, Modular Monolith, SOLID, 12-Factor, Resilience Patterns, Strangler Fig, Team Topologies). Real Korean growth scenarios (Toss, Kakao, Coupang, Naver) and regulatory context (FSC, 전자금융업 electronic finance business rules, PG integration). Invoke /code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `code` (Software engineering meta-router — auto-selects from 15 frameworks (debugging, architecture, design, resilience, evolution, team topology, security, CI/CD, API…), `bisection` (Bisection — git bisect, binary search, delta debugging), `ddd` (Domain-Driven Design (Eric Evans) — tackles complex business domains through language, boundaries, and models), `event-sourcing-cqrs` (Event Sourcing + CQRS (Greg Young) — store events instead of state; state is a fold of events), `hexagonal` (Hexagonal Architecture (Ports & Adapters) — Alistair Cockburn), `modular-monolith` (Modular Monolith — an architecture that enforces strict module boundaries within a single deployment unit), `observability` (Observability — Infer internal system state from external signals using USE (Gregg) + RED (Wilkie) + Four Golden…), `resilience-patterns` (Resilience Patterns — Circuit Breaker·Bulkhead·Back-pressure·Rate Limiting·Retry with jitter·Timeout), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install software-framework@claude-community` from `ironyjk/software-framework`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
